# DATA120 Python 3.13 local configuration TEMPLATE — no actual secrets.
# Make a LOCAL copy: Copy-Item python/.env.example python/.env
# Only put real values in python/.env, which must remain untracked.
#
# The Sheets API does NOT use your Google account password.
# Set the path to a Google OAuth/service-account credential file kept outside Git.
# Grant only the required read access; no Sheet write permissions.
GOOGLE_SHEETS_ID=
GOOGLE_SHEETS_CREDENTIALS_FILE=
GOOGLE_SHEETS_READ_RANGE=
GOOGLE_SHEETS_SCOPES=https://www.googleapis.com/auth/spreadsheets.readonly
#
# Only supply a real private key if the approved pseudonymization design requires it.
# Never commit this key or use example placeholder keys with live data.
PARKINGPATROL_PSEUDONYMIZATION_SECRET=
#
# Never put raw licence plates or actual operational rows in the sample.
